    "The public-backdoor route genuinely closes the historical R47 controller stall, but the same homogeneous Horn/Krom size route is substantially larger on the other frozen R50G25X residuals.",
    "Finite backdoor values cannot establish or refute an O(log n) bound on any infinite family; ratios on fifteen fixed instances have no asymptotic authority.",
